# Google Drive: built into every build, so any device can connect without setup.
# These identify the app (they are visible in the page anyway) and are safe to commit.
# The Picker API key is not here: paste it under Documents → Set up Google Drive,
# or add it as a GitHub repository variable named VITE_GOOGLE_API_KEY.
# Anything in .env.local overrides these on your machine.
